umbnail": {"file_name": "Parcel Pummel.png", "id": "1490423681959604", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298930_1490423685292937_7312217641083823550_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3IUJp2o6a9IQ7kNvwEx7slq&_nc_oc=Adq6aKzwPl-yzoIU4OKBLgVR8yl5Ui-RX0YlLQ5wDhIBZ_y1wZ27CK_A0riGltzhiWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-Lb9faCNqWD-gNwcqWc8H_J9VWeMFDXE_ziWxyUeP2w&oe=6AFF0E45"}, "display_name": "Parcel Pummel", "keywords": ["arcade", "simulator", "pixel", "throwing"], "long_description": "Welcome to your first day on the warehouse floor, conveyors are down, automation\u2019s looming, and it\u2019s up to you to keep the parcels moving.\n\nParcel Pummel is a fast-paced VR action game where you match, grab, and launch colour-coded packages into the right delivery trucks. Beat the clock, master your aim, and rise through increasingly frantic levels in this pixel-styled, physically engaging experience.\n\nFeatures:\n\ud83d\udce6 Intuitive throwing mechanics\n\u23f1\ufe0f Beat-the-clock gameplay with escalating difficulty\n\ud83c\udfae Retro-inspired visuals and immersive sound\n\ud83d\ude9a Challenge yourself with new levels and parcel chaos\n\nBuilt originally for VR Game Jam 2023, Parcel Pummel blends nostalgic charm with modern VR action. Whether you're a casual player or competitive speed-runner, this warehouse won't sort itself... time to pummel some parcels.", "short_description": "Step into the warehouse and sort chaos with speed and precision in Parcel Pummel, a fast-paced VR game where you throw colour-coded parcels into the correct trucks before time runs out. Built for immersive, intuitive fun, with a retro aesthetic and warehouse mayhem."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fovrinteractive.net/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FoVR Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https: